{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xLAjT5rhih1794888878.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一間私家醫院9月涉嫌錯誤切除一名女病人的雙側卵巢。據了解，涉事的是中大醫院。</p><p></p><p>衞生署指，9月13日收到一宗私家醫院呈報的醫療風險事件，指一名45歲女病人進行腹腔鏡子宮及雙側輸卵管切除手術時，被錯誤切除雙側卵巢。病人情況穩定，無證據顯示醫院在人手、設備方面違反實務守則要求。</p><p></p><p>另一宗涉及牙科中心的事故，中心涉認錯一名27歲女病人，為她接受洗牙治療，病人情況穩定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:26.128810+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:54.242977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:42:35.116344+00:00","content_hash":"422f9000eec803f3f96376d056fcae896bfe355dbae1c97b62b8d5aa8f72df6e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}